412
00:41:12,040 --> 00:41:14,880
The harbour lights went out one by one.

413
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:19,120
A ferry crossed the bay without a sound.

414
00:41:19,600 --> 00:41:24,200
We counted the boats until the fog took the last of them and the bells began to ring.

415
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:28,400
Nobody on the pier said a word,

416
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:31,560
and the tide came in all the same.

417
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:34,900
It was time to go home.
